# Assistant content: the verbose (ctrl+o) toggle after a turn that ran a
# read tool call. internal/tui/app.go's toggleVerbose flips
# Bridge.SetVerbose; once verbose, app.go's status row (line 2104) shows
# "Showing detailed transcript · ctrl+o to toggle · ? for shortcuts" with
# a right-aligned "verbose" label, and a finished turn with a tool call
# commits a RenderVerboseModelRow timestamp+model line (transcript.go).
@fixture testdata/behaviour/design
@faux testdata/faux/qa/content-verbose.yaml
@size 120x40

WAITFOR /describe a task/ 20
SHOT welcome
TYPE what dependencies does this project have
KEY enter
WAITFOR /small Node project with one dependency/ 20
SHOT reply-non-verbose
EXPECT /read/
EXPECT /package\.json/
EXPECT_NOT /Showing detailed transcript/
KEY ctrl+o
SHOT reply-verbose
EXPECT /Showing detailed transcript · ctrl\+o to toggle · \? for shortcuts/
EXPECT /verbose/
EXPECT /faux-1/
KEY ctrl+o
SHOT reply-non-verbose-again
EXPECT_NOT /Showing detailed transcript/
EXPECT_NOT /panic|goroutine/
